reak: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><strong data-end=\"5759\" data-start=\"5734\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><strong data-end=\"6143\" data-start=\"6113\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 14px;\">Use High-Quality Creatives:</span></strong><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">&nbsp;</span></span></strong><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Eye-catching visuals improve engagement.</span></span></li><li data-end=\"6069\" data-start=\"5917\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><strong data-end=\"5943\" data-start=\"5919\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Leverage retargeting</strong>: Retarget website visitors or people who\u2019ve interacted with your messaging app to bring them back to complete the conversion.</span></span></li><li data-end=\"6238\" data-start=\"6070\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><strong data-end=\"6095\" data-start=\"6072\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Optimise for mobile</strong>: Ensure your website and messaging app are optimised for mobile users, as a significant portion of Meta Ads traffic comes from mobile devices.</span></span></li><li data-end=\"6367\" data-start=\"6239\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 14px;\"><strong data-end=\"6259\" data-start=\"6241\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Test and learn</strong>: Continuously test your ad creatives, targeting options, and budgets to optimise your campaign performance.</span></li></ul><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"></p></span></div>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000006427-why-are-my-calls-marked-as-spam-and-how-can-i-avoid-it-", "title": "Why are my Calls marked as Spam, and How can I avoid it ?", "folder": "LeadConnector Phone", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155054640190/original/FvtW_mpD1mIpr0W0AZ4L-PAHYn0wCVi5lA69d6.png?1758870842", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155054640191/original/jxzMtbUiY7JQl7NQjWfIhva6BF8ym3sUqA0a3f.png?1758870843", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155054640744/original/kXIU4_8SF_4hbSnLhmWmff8s5-QKAONZ_A41a4.png?1758871386", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155054640240/original/NWTImJtRzBsmiGM334byPVgTo6r8Yr0CNAf12c.png?1758870886"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 24px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Overview</strong></span><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\">If your business calls are being flagged as 'Spam Likely' or 'Scam,' it can reduce answer rates and harm your credibility. This guide explains why calls are marked as spam and provides actionable steps to prevent it.</span><br><br></p><p class=\"fd-toc\"><strong>TABLE OF CONTENTS</strong></p><ul><ul><li><a href=\"#Why-Are-Calls-Marked-as-Spam?\">Why Are Calls Marked as Spam?</a><ul><li><a href=\"#Common-Reasons-for-Spam-Labelling%3A\">Common Reasons for Spam Labelling:</a></li></ul></li><li><a href=\"#Key-Impacts-of-Calls-Being-Marked-as-Spam\">Key Impacts of Calls Being Marked as Spam</a></li><li><a href=\"#How-to-Prevent-Your-Calls-from-Being-Marked-as-Spam\">How to Prevent Your Calls from Being Marked as Spam</a></li></ul><li><a href=\"#Why-Turn-On-Voice-Integrity?\">Why Turn On Voice Integrity?</a><ul><li><a href=\"#What-You-Need-to-Get-Started\">What You Need to Get Started</a></li><li><a href=\"#What-Happens-After-You-Register?\">What Happens After You Register?</a><ul><li><a href=\"#2.-Enable-SHAKEN/STIR-Authentication-(U.S.-Only)\">2. Enable SHAKEN/STIR Authentication (U.S. Only)</a></li><li><a href=\"#Note-%C2%A0An-EIN-(Employer-Identification-Number)-is-required-to-complete-SHAKEN/STIR-registration.%C2%A0If-you-don%E2%80%99t-have-an-EIN,-we-recommend-registering-your-number-with-the-Free-Call-Registry-instead.\">Note-&nbsp;An EIN (Employer Identification Number) is required to complete SHAKEN/STIR registration.&nbsp;If you don\u2019t have an EIN, we recommend registering your number with the Free Call Registry instead.</a></li><li><a href=\"#3.-Update-CNAM-(Caller-Name-Presentation)-Information\">3. Update CNAM (Caller Name Presentation) Information</a></li><li><a href=\"#4.-Contact-the-Terminating-Carrier-(For-International-Numbers)\">4. Contact the Terminating Carrier (For International Numbers)</a></li><li><a href=\"#5.-Consider-Replacing-the-Phone-Number\">5. Consider Replacing the Phone Number</a></li></ul></li><li><a href=\"#Frequently-Asked-Questions\">Frequently Asked Questions</a><br><br></li></ul></li></ul><h2 id=\"Why-Are-Calls-Marked-as-Spam?\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 24px;\">Why Are Calls Marked as Spam?</span></strong></h2><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\">Carriers and mobile devices use algorithms to detect and flag suspicious calls. If your number is labeled as spam, customers may ignore or block your calls, impacting your business communication.</span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h3 id=\"Common-Reasons-for-Spam-Labelling:\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.17em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\">Common Reasons for Spam Labelling:</span></strong></h3><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><ul data-spread=\"false\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\">High Call Volumes:</span></strong><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;Making too many calls in a short time can trigger spam filters.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></span></p></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Unfamiliar Numbers:</strong> Calls from numbers not recognized by the recipient or without proper caller ID.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></span></p></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Frequent Customer Complaints:</strong> If your number has been reported as spam multiple times.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></span></p></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Low Engagement Rates:</strong> If a high percentage of your calls go unanswered or are rejected.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></span></p></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">SHAKEN/STIR Authentication Failures:</strong> If your caller ID isn\u2019t verified, it may be flagged.</span></p></li></ul><h2 id=\"Key-Impacts-of-Calls-Being-Marked-as-Spam\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 24px;\">Key Impacts of Calls Being Marked as Spam</span></strong></h2><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13p