-start=\"1324\" data-end=\"1327\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Confirms your calls are legitimate and not spoofed.</span></p></li><li data-end=\"1494\" data-start=\"1382\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"1494\" data-start=\"1384\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><strong data-end=\"1405\" data-start=\"1384\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">CNAM Registration</strong> (Recommended):<br data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1423\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Displays your business name as the caller ID, increasing credibility.</span></p></li><li data-end=\"1633\" data-start=\"1496\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"1633\" data-start=\"1498\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><strong data-end=\"1525\" data-start=\"1498\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">U.S. Phone Numbers Only</strong>:<br data-start=\"1526\" data-end=\"1529\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Currently, Voice Integrity applies only to U.S.-based numbers. International traffic is not supported.</span></p></li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, 