"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\">Expect to receive confirmation emails within 2 business days<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></span></p></li><li data-end=\"4688\" data-start=\"4624\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"4688\" data-start=\"4626\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\">Spam label removal can take longer to reflect across all platforms.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></span></p></li></ul><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h3 id=\"2.-Enable-SHAKEN/STIR-Authentication-(U.S.-Only)\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.17em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">2. Enable SHAKEN/STIR Authentication (U.S. Only)</strong></h3><h3 id=\"Note-&nbsp;An-EIN-(Employer-Identification-Number)-is-required-to-complete-SHAKEN/STIR-registration.&nbsp;If-you-don\u2019t-have-an-EIN,-we-recommend-registering-your-number-with-the-Free-Call-Registry-instead.\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.17em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Note</span></strong><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">-&nbsp;</span><strong data-end=\"145\" data-start=\"52\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">An EIN (Employer Identification Number) is required to complete SHAKEN/STIR registration</span>.</strong></span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;If you don\u2019t have an EIN, we recommend registering your number with the <a class=\"cursor-pointer\" data-end=\"340\" data-start=\"218\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_new\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(44, 92, 197); cursor: pointer;\"></a><a href=\"https://help.gohighlevel.com/support/solutions/articles/155000005891-remediate-spam-likely-on-your-caller-id-using-free-caller-registry\" rel=\"noreferrer\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(44, 92, 197);\" target=\"_blank\">Free Call Registry</a> instead.</span></strong></h3><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">SHAKEN/STIR is a set of protocols designed to authenticate caller ID information and verify that it is coming from a legitimate source. The protocol works by using digital certificates to validate the caller's identity. When a call is made, the caller's identity is verified through these certificates, which are then stored in an online database. This ensures that when someone receives a call, they can trust that it is coming from who they think it is.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155054640744/original/kXIU4_8SF_4hbSnLhmWmff8s5-QKAONZ_A41a4.png?1758871386\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib inline-image\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: auto;\" data-id=\"155054640744\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><ul data-spread=\"false\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">These protocols verify your caller ID information, preventing fraud.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Contact your phone service provider to enable SHAKEN/STIR on your number.</p></li></ul><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--idea\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow: visible; font-family: monospace, monospace; font-size: 13px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 12px 16px; border-width: 1px 1px 1px 6px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(235, 237, 240) rgb(235, 237, 240) rgb(235, 237, 240) rgb(44, 92, 197); border-image: initial; border-radius: 8px 4px 4px 8px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Note</span></strong><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">: SHAKEN/STIR won't remove nuisance labels but may boost answer rates due to the \"Trusted Call\" label.</span></pre><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h3 id=\"3.-Update-CNAM-(Caller-Name-Presentation)-Information\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.17em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">3. Update CNAM (Caller Name Presentation) Information</strong></h3><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">Updating or adding CNAM (Caller Name Presentation) might increase call answers by offering accurate caller information, though it won't affect nuisance labels. CNAM is a feature in the United States public telephone network that identifies an incoming caller by a personal or business name associated with the calling party.</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155054640240/original/NWTImJtRzBsmiGM334byPVgTo6r8Yr0CNAf12c.png?1758870886\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib fr-bordered inline-image\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; padding: 0px 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0px; width: auto;\" data-id=\"155054640240\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--idea\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow: visible; font-family: monospace, monospace; font-size: 13px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 12px 16px; border-width: 1px 1px 1px 6px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(235, 237, 240) rgb(235, 237, 240) rgb(235, 237, 240) rgb(44, 92, 197); border-image: initial; border-radius: 8px 4px 4px 8px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Note</strong>: CNAM doesn't remove nuisance labels, but accurate caller information can enhance answer rates.</span></pre><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><ul data-spread=\"false\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Ensure your number correctly displays your business name on the caller ID.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Work with your carrier to register or update your CNAM records.</p></li></ul><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto py-5 [--thread-content-margin:--spacing(4)] @[37rem]:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(6)] @[72rem]:[--thread-content-margin:--spacing(16)] px-(--thread-content-margin)\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:32rem] @[34rem]:[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @[64rem]:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto flex max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 text-base gap-4 md:gap-5 lg:gap-6 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; flex: 1 1 0%; gap: 4px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\"><div class=\"group/conversation-turn relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\"><div class=\"relative flex-col gap-1 md:gap-3\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\"><div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\"><div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"b9142298-3497-4b19-b1b5-259dac369b9f\" data-message-model-slug=\"o4-mini-high\" dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; gap: 2px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\"><div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words light\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4;\"><blockquote data-end=\"481\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\" data-start=\"282\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 6px 6px 1px 1em; margin-bottom: 0.5em; margin-left: 0.5em; font-size: 13px; border-left: 1px dotted rgb(153, 153, 153); line-height: 22px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);\"><p data-end=\"481\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-start=\"284\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(184, 49, 47);\">Any entity with a business registration number\u2014including sole proprietors with an EIN\u2014may sign up for CNAM. An EIN is mandatory, whether you\u2019re a one-person operation or a larger, registered brand.</span></strong></p></blockquote></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h3 id=\"4.-Contact-the-Terminating-Carrier-(For-International-Numbers)\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.17em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">4. Contact the Terminating Carrier (For International Numbers)</strong></h3><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">Currently, there is no centralized system to remove spam labels from international numbers. If your calls are flagged as spam outside the US, contact the terminating carrier directly to address the issue.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 35px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"></p><h3 id=\"5.-Consider-Replacing-the-Phone-Number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.17em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">5. Consider Replacing the Phone Number</strong></h3><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">If the phone number flagged as \u2018Spam Likely\u2019 is relatively new, non-critical, or has an FTC complaint associated with it, replacing the number may be the fastest and easiest solution.</p><h2 id=\"Frequently-Asked-Questions\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Frequently Asked Questions</strong></h2><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(44, 130, 201);\">Q. Will registering my number immediately remove spam labels?</span></strong></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">Not necessarily. Registration helps, but it may take time for carriers to update records.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(44, 130, 201);\">Q. Should I register newly acquired numbers?</span></strong></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">Yes, registering new numbers can prevent potential spam mislabeling.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(44, 130, 201);\">Q. How long does Voice integrity registration take?</span></strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">Approval can take up to 2 <strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">business days</strong>.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(44, 130, 201);\">Q. Is there a cost for voice integrity submission?</span></strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">No, registering with the voice integrity is <strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">completely free</strong>.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p class=\"line\" data-identifyelement=\"594\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(44, 130, 201);\">Q. How will phone numbers be linked to the SHAKEN/STIR Profile?</span></strong></p><p class=\"line\" data-identifyelement=\"594\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">All numbers will be Linked Automatically. All current available numbers and future bought numbers will automatically be linked with the registered SHAKEN/STIR.<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"></span></p><h2 id=\"-1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br></h2>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000001517-one-time-link", "title": "One Time Link", "folder": "Calendars", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155014409460/original/tJYXyaOQZmJNdHJzXRq97if3mpqCUwBGYg8c8a.png?1701779399", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155014410379/original/gMZzOPcD61-89Nzbv1-uHpAvA9b4vROLGg0f4c.png?1701779522", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155017921967/original/0a9KPoIvrzO9tf424NAh1cIqgql9w2B9Kgc304.png?1705483353"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p class=\"fd-toc\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">In This Article</strong><a href=\"#What-is-a-One-Time-Link?\" dir=\"ltr\"></a></p><ul><li class=\"fd-toc\"><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#What-is-a-One-Time-Link?\">What is a One Time Link?</a></li><li><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#%C2%A0Why-are-One-Time-Links-important?\">Why are One Time Links important?</a></li><li><a href=\"#How-to-Share-a-One-Time-Link?\">How to Share a One Time Link?</a></li><li><a href=\"#What-Happens-After-Booking?\">What Happens After Booking?</a></li></ul><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Related Article</strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"155000001710.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" dir=\"ltr\"></a></strong><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"155000001710.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"155000001710.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Workflow Action for Generating One Time Link</a></p><hr><p></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"155000001710.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><strong dir=\"ltr\"><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"155000001710.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a></strong></p><h4 dir=\"ltr\" id=\"What-is-a-One-Time-Link?\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">What is a One Time Link?</strong></span></h4><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><br style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"></span></span></span></p><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">A One Time Link is a unique scheduling link to your calendar, <span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">designed to automatically expire once an appointment has been scheduled.</span>Unlike the permanent link or the scheduling link, a One Time Link <span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">offers a one time access to your calendar.&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></p><hr><h4 id=\"&nbsp;Why-are-One-Time-Links-important?\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Why are One Time Links important?</strong></span></span></span></h4><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><br style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"></span></span></span></p><ul><li style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">One Time Links are valuable across businesses, particularly for individuals who prefer not to share their entire calendar.&nbsp;</span></span></span></li><li style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">These links automatically expire after each booking, giving you more control over your availability and preventing unwanted bookings.&nbsp;</span></span></span></li><li style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">Once someone uses the link to book time with you, they can't do it again unless you give them a new link.&nbsp;</span></span></span></li><li style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">This also prevents attendees from sharing your availability with people you don't know.</span></span></span></li></ul><hr><h4 id=\"How-to-Share-a-One-Time-Link?\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">How to Share a One Time Link?</strong></span></span></span></h4><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><br style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"></span></p><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">To share a one time link to your calendar:</span></span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><br style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"></span></span></span></p><ul><li style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">Navigate to Calendar Settings &gt; Calendars.</span></span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">Click on the three dots next to your calendar and select \"Share.\"</span></span></span></li></ul><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--note\" dir=\"ltr\">Note: You can now access the Scheduling Link, Permanent Link, One Time Link and Embed Code from the \"Share\" option in Calendar Settings</pre><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><br></span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155014409460/original/tJYXyaOQZmJNdHJzXRq97if3mpqCUwBGYg8c8a.png?1701779399\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155014409460\"></span></span></span></p><p><br></p><ul><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">In the sharing&nbsp;</span><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">options, locate the \"One Time Link\" tab.</span></span></span></li></ul><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><br></span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155014410379/original/gMZzOPcD61-89Nzbv1-uHpAvA9b4vROLGg0f4c.png?1701779522\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155014410379\"></span></span></span><br></p><ul><li style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\">Click on \"Copy\" to easily copy &amp; paste the One Time Link wherever needed.</span></span></span></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 16px;\">To create a new link, click on the \"Generate New Link\" option to obtain a fresh URL.</li></ul><hr><h4 id=\"What-Happens-After-Booking?\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">What Happens After Booking?</strong></span></span></span></h4><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica Neue;\"><br style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"></span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 16px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">When a booking is made and the link expires, if someone attempts to schedule another appointment using the same link, they will be prompted to contact the owner as the link has already expired. This ensures that only valid and current links are used for scheduling purposes.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155017921967/original/0a9KPoIvrzO9tf424NAh1cIqgql9w2B9Kgc304.png?1705483353\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155017921967\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000005593-how-to-customise-prospecting-report-with-report-builder", "title": "How to Access the Report Builder", "folder": "Prospecting Tool", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155048847433/original/4C3-0f81CV4PTu6rPkW5RpnJF5vz7ahCuQ271d.png?1750848331", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155048846421/original/roa4AwWSZzwO2V5I4HBF86ZxGvXnTjBQOA50cf.jpg?1750847542", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155048845996/original/ljZcNGKRAVR-HMrtLuok76a_VGEGLA2p9wa413.jpg?1750847212", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155048846035/original/25V0TFzeULQ5VBxu9zSuoOd9Ci9-6s9REAd426.jpg?1750847241", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155048846057/original/3kjSDAeQ8nC-KwdaTAo8dn5DYBdf2tOJSgd957.jpg?1750847261", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155048846073/original/8AA6zPvLhuByAr1Wtriki0QJOcAAdG6H4gf016.jpg?1750847285", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155048846183/original/hkLtnCL7IgGXEKkcCe8_TtozmS-J3h9pMAa91a.jpg?1750847337", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155048846156/original/pSky1l4Txykkl--6GZky4T2WGzMMtVJ-YAcf3a.jpg?1750847321", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155048846282/original/encSERqjwxG100X1nWxYEVAQLgtR3p03UA96c3.jpg?1750847397"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p data-end=\"494\" data-start=\"264\">We\u2019re excited to introduce a major upgrade to your <strong data-end=\"338\" data-start=\"315\">Prospecting Reports</strong> experience:<br data-start=\"350\" data-end=\"353\">A <strong data-end=\"394\" data-start=\"355\">completely redesigned Web Report UI</strong> and a powerful <strong data-end=\"428\" data-start=\"410\">Report Builder</strong> that gives you total control over how your reports look and feel.</p><p data-end=\"494\" data-start=\"264\"><br></p><p data-end=\"661\" data-start=\"496\" dir=\"ltr\">This update is all about helping customers tell their brand story, create better first impressions, and close more deals with custom-branded, high-converting reports.</p><hr data-start=\"663\" data-end=\"666\"><h2 data-end=\"706\" data-start=\"668\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong>What\u2019s New in the Web Report UI?</strong></h2><p data-end=\"814\" data-start=\"708\">We've made big improvements to streamline the report reading experience \u2014 both for you and your prospects.</p><h3 data-end=\"839\" data-start=\"816\">? UI Enhancements:</h3><ol data-end=\"1198\" data-start=\"840\"><li data-end=\"1000\" data-start=\"840\"><p data-end=\"865\" data-start=\"843\"><strong data-end=\"865\" data-start=\"843\">Streamlined Header</strong></p><ul data-end=\"1000\" data-start=\"869\"><li data-end=\"939\" data-start=\"869\"><p data-end=\"939\" data-start=\"871\">The previous sticky header that took up too much space is now fixed.</p></li><li data-end=\"1000\" data-start=\"943\"><p data-end=\"1000\" data-start=\"945\">The header no longer obstructs content while scrolling.</p></li></ul></li><li data-end=\"1198\" data-start=\"1002\"><p data-end=\"1025\" data-start=\"1005\"><strong data-end=\"1025\" data-start=\"1005\">Optimized Layout</strong></p><ul data-end=\"1198\" data-start=\"1029\"><li data-end=\"1081\" data-start=\"1029\"><p data-end=\"1081\" data-start=\"1031\">We\u2019ve removed empty white margins from both sides.</p></li><li data-end=\"1198\" data-start=\"1085\"><p data-end=\"1198\" data-start=\"1087\">The report is now <strong data-end=\"1130\" data-start=\"1105\">cleaner, more compact</strong>, and easier to navigate \u2014 with better content visibility and focus.</p></li></ul></li></ol><p><br></p><p data-end=\"1198\" data-start=\"1087\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155048847433/original/4C3-0f81CV4PTu6rPkW5RpnJF5vz7ahCuQ271d.png?1750848331\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155048847433\"></p><p><br></p><p data-end=\"1198\" data-start=\"1087\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155048846421/original/roa4AwWSZzwO2V5I4HBF86ZxGvXnTjBQOA50cf.jpg?1750847542\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"155048846421\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; padding: 0px 1px; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0px; width: auto;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></p><p><br></p><blockquote data-end=\"1343\" data-start=\"1200\"><p data-end=\"1343\" data-start=\"1202\" dir=\"ltr\">? <strong data-end=\"1214\" data-start=\"1205\">Note:</strong> This new UI is available only for <strong data-end=\"1264\" data-start=\"1249\">Web Reports</strong>at this moment.&nbsp;</p><p dir=\"ltr\">his time.The updated <strong data-end=\"1308\" data-start=\"1293\">PDF version</strong> is in development and coming soon!</p><br></blockquote><p><br></p><hr data-start=\"1345\" data-end=\"1348\"><h2 data-end=\"1394\" data-start=\"1350\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Introducing the All-New Report Builder</strong></h2><p data-end=\"1547\" data-start=\"1396\">Our most requested feature is finally here \u2014 <strong data-end=\"1479\" data-start=\"1441\">fully customizable report branding</strong>. You now have the power to tailor the report experience end-to-end.</p><hr data-start=\"1549\" data-end=\"1552\"><h2 data-end=\"1592\" data-start=\"1554\" dir=\"ltr\">How to Access the Report Builder</h2><ol data-end=\"2064\" data-start=\"1594\"><li data-end=\"1657\" data-start=\"1594\"><p data-end=\"1657\" data-start=\"1597\">Available at both <strong data-end=\"1631\" data-start=\"1615\">Agency level</strong> and <strong data-end=\"1657\" data-start=\"1636\">Sub-Account level</strong></p></li><li data-end=\"1876\" data-start=\"1658\"><p data-end=\"1876\" data-start=\"1661\">Requires a <strong data-end=\"1708\" data-start=\"1672\">Premium Prospecting Subscription</strong><br data-start=\"1708\" data-end=\"1711\"><em data-end=\"1876\" data-start=\"1714\" dir=\"ltr\">(If you're already subscribed, you have access right away. If you're using Basic Prospecting, you can explore Report Builder but won't be able to save changes.)</em></p><ol><li data-end=\"1876\" data-start=\"1658\"><p data-end=\"1876\" data-start=\"1661\"><em data-end=\"1876\" data-start=\"1714\" dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155048845996/original/ljZcNGKRAVR-HMrtLuok76a_VGEGLA2p9wa413.jpg?1750847212\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"155048845996\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; padding: 0px 1px; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; text-indent: 0px; font-weight: 400; width: 448px;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></em></p></li></ol></li><li data-end=\"2007\" data-start=\"1878\"><p data-end=\"1887\" data-start=\"1881\">Go to:</p><ul data-end=\"2007\" data-start=\"1891\"><li data-end=\"1945\" data-start=\"1891\"><p data-end=\"1945\" data-start=\"1893\"><strong data-end=\"1908\" data-start=\"1893\">Agency View</strong> \u2192 Click on the <strong data-end=\"1939\" data-start=\"1924\">Prospecting</strong> tab</p></li><li data-end=\"2007\" data-start=\"1949\"><p data-end=\"2007\" data-start=\"1951\"><strong data-end=\"1971\" data-start=\"1951\">Sub-Account View</strong> \u2192 Go to <strong data-end=\"2007\" data-start=\"1980\">Marketing \u2192 Prospecting</strong></p></li></ul></li><li data-end=\"2064\" data-start=\"2009\"><p data-end=\"2064\" data-start=\"2012\" dir=\"ltr\">Click on the <strong data-end=\"2045\" data-start=\"2025\">\u201cReport Builder\u201d</strong> tab to get started</p></li></ol><hr data-start=\"2293\" data-end=\"2296\"><h2 data-end=\"2332\" data-start=\"2298\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong>How to Customize Your Report</strong></h2><h3 data-end=\"2372\" data-start=\"2334\">1\ufe0f\u20e3 <strong data-end=\"2372\" data-start=\"2342\">Choose the Section to Edit</strong></h3><p data-end=\"2428\" data-start=\"2373\">The Report Builder is divided into 4 customizable tabs:</p><ul data-end=\"2533\" data-start=\"2429\"><li data-end=\"2446\" data-start=\"2429\"><p data-end=\"2446\" data-start=\"2431\"><strong data-end=\"2446\" data-start=\"2431\">Brand Theme</strong></p></li><li data-end=\"2473\" data-start=\"2447\"><p data-end=\"2473\" data-start=\"2449\"><strong data-end=\"2473\" data-start=\"2449\">Header Customization</strong></p></li><li data-end=\"2506\" data-start=\"2474\"><p data-end=\"2506\" data-start=\"2476\"><strong data-end=\"2506\" data-start=\"2476\">Introduction Customization</strong></p></li><li data-end=\"2533\" data-start=\"2507\"><p data-end=\"2533\" data-start=\"2509\"><strong data-end=\"2533\" data-start=\"2509\">Footer Customization</strong></p></li></ul><p data-end=\"2620\" data-start=\"2535\">Simply click a tab and start editing. You\u2019ll see <strong data-end=\"2614\" data-start=\"2584\">live previews on the right</strong> side.</p><hr data-start=\"2622\" data-end=\"2625\"><h3 data-end=\"2653\" data-start=\"2627\">2\ufe0f\u20e3 <strong data-end=\"2653\" data-start=\"2635\">Preview &amp; Save</strong></h3><ul data-end=\"2859\" data-start=\"2654\"><li data-end=\"2712\" data-start=\"2654\"><p data-end=\"2712\" data-start=\"2656\">Click <strong data-end=\"2675\" data-start=\"2662\">\u201cPreview\u201d</strong> to open the full report in a new tab</p></li><li data-end=\"2787\" data-start=\"2713\"><p data-end=\"2787\" data-start=\"2715\">Click <strong data-end=\"2731\" data-start=\"2721\">\u201cSave\u201d</strong> to apply changes across <strong data-end=\"2787\" data-start=\"2756\">all past and future reports</strong></p></li><li data-end=\"2859\" data-start=\"2788\"><p data-end=\"2859\" data-start=\"2790\">You can also use <strong data-end=\"2829\" data-start=\"2807\">\u201cReset to Default\u201d</strong> to revert your customizations</p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"2861\" data-end=\"2864\"><h2 data-end=\"500\" data-start=\"472\"><strong data-end=\"498\" data-start=\"479\" dir=\"ltr\">Brand Theme Tab</strong></h2><p><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155048846035/original/25V0TFzeULQ5VBxu9zSuoOd9Ci9-6s9REAd426.jpg?1750847241\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; padding: 0px 1px; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0px; width: auto;\" data-id=\"155048846035\"></p><p data-end=\"542\" data-start=\"501\"><br></p><p data-end=\"644\" data-start=\"544\" dir=\"ltr\">This section allows you to define your brand's visual identity across the report. You can customize:</p><ul data-end=\"1222\" data-start=\"646\"><li data-end=\"755\" data-start=\"646\"><p data-end=\"755\" data-start=\"648\"><strong data-end=\"665\" data-start=\"648\">Primary Color</strong>: The main background or base color used across the report (e.g., background of sections).</p></li><li data-end=\"849\" data-start=\"756\"><p data-end=\"849\" data-start=\"758\"><strong data-end=\"777\" data-start=\"758\">Secondary Color</strong>: A supporting accent color used subtly to complement the primary color.</p></li><li data-end=\"935\" data-start=\"850\"><p data-end=\"935\" data-start=\"852\"><strong data-end=\"873\" data-start=\"852\">Report Text Color</strong>: This controls the main text color inside the report content.</p></li><li data-end=\"1038\" data-start=\"936\"><p data-end=\"1038\" data-start=\"938\"><strong data-end=\"959\" data-start=\"938\">Header Link Color</strong>: Sets the color for any clickable links in the header (like your website URL).</p></li><li data-end=\"1145\" data-start=\"1039\"><p data-end=\"1145\" data-start=\"1041\"><strong data-end=\"1065\" data-start=\"1041\">CTA Background Color</strong>: Color of the call-to-action (CTA) buttons like \"Connect Now\" or \"Contact Now\".</p></li><li data-end=\"1222\" data-start=\"1146\"><p data-end=\"1222\" data-start=\"1148\"><strong data-end=\"1166\" data-start=\"1148\">CTA Text Color</strong>: The color of the text displayed inside the CTA button.</p></li></ul><p data-end=\"1389\" data-start=\"1224\">? All changes will instantly reflect in the <strong data-end=\"1299\" data-start=\"1269\">preview panel on the right</strong>.<br data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1303\">\u2705 Use this to align your reports with your brand\u2019s website, logo, or marketing assets.</p><p data-end=\"1389\" data-start=\"1224\"><br></p><p data-end=\"1389\" data-start=\"1224\"><br></p><hr data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1394\"><h2 data-end=\"1459\" data-start=\"1396\"><strong data-end=\"1457\" data-start=\"1403\">Header Customization \u2013 Visibility Options &amp; Design</strong></h2><p data-end=\"1572\" data-start=\"1493\" dir=\"ltr\">This section gives you control over what elements show up in the report header.</p><p data-end=\"1491\" data-start=\"1460\"><em data-end=\"1491\" data-start=\"1460\" dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155048846057/original/3kjSDAeQ8nC-KwdaTAo8dn5DYBdf2tOJSgd957.jpg?1750847261\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; padding: 0px 1px; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0px; width: auto;\" data-id=\"155048846057\"></em></p><h3 data-end=\"1600\" data-start=\"1574\" dir=\"ltr\">Visibility Toggles:</h3><ul data-end=\"2034\" data-start=\"1601\"><li data-end=\"1667\" data-start=\"1601\"><p data-end=\"1667\" data-start=\"1603\"><strong data-end=\"1623\" data-start=\"1603\">Show Header Logo</strong>: Toggle to display/hide your business logo.</p></li><li data-end=\"1735\" data-start=\"1668\"><p data-end=\"1735\" data-start=\"1670\"><strong data-end=\"1693\" data-start=\"1670\">Show Header Website</strong>: Show or hide your business website link.</p></li><li data-end=\"1851\" data-start=\"1736\"><p data-end=\"1851\" data-start=\"1738\"><strong data-end=\"1765\" data-start=\"1738\">Show Header Description</strong>: A short line like a tagline or supportive text (e.g., \u201cNeed help with your audit?\u201d).</p></li><li data-end=\"1946\" data-start=\"1852\"><p data-end=\"1946\" data-start=\"1854\"><strong data-end=\"1885\" data-start=\"1854\">Show Header Email / Contact</strong>: Choose whether to show your contact email and phone number.</p></li><li data-end=\"2034\" data-start=\"1947\"><p data-end=\"2034\" data-start=\"1949\"><strong data-end=\"1975\" data-start=\"1949\">Show Header CTA Button</strong>: Enable or hide the main action button like \u201cContact Now.\u201d</p></li></ul><p><br></p><p data-end=\"2034\" data-start=\"1949\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155048846073/original/8AA6zPvLhuByAr1Wtriki0QJOcAAdG6H4gf016.jpg?1750847285\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; padding: 0px 1px; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0px; width: auto;\" data-id=\"155048846073\"></p><p><br></p><h3 data-end=\"2065\" data-start=\"2036\">\u270d\ufe0f Header Design Options:</h3><ul data-end=\"2226\" data-start=\"2066\"><li data-end=\"2127\" data-start=\"2066\"><p data-end=\"2127\" data-start=\"2068\"><strong data-end=\"2083\" data-start=\"2068\">Font Family</strong>: Choose the typeface (e.g., Arial, Roboto).</p></li><li data-end=\"2189\" data-start=\"2128\"><p data-end=\"2189\" data-start=\"2130\"><strong data-end=\"2145\" data-start=\"2130\">Font Weight</strong>: Set font thickness (Normal, Medium, Bold).</p></li><li data-end=\"2226\" data-start=\"2190\"><p data-end=\"2226\" data-start=\"2192\"><strong data-end=\"2206\" data-start=\"2192\">Font Style</strong>: Regular or Italic.</p></li></ul><p data-end=\"2226\" data-start=\"2192\"><br></p><p><br></p><p data-end=\"2343\" data-start=\"2228\" dir=\"ltr\">These settings help personalize the tone of your message \u2014 from clean and professional to bold and eye-catching.</p><hr data-start=\"2345\" data-end=\"2348\"><h2 data-end=\"2393\" data-start=\"2350\"><strong data-end=\"2391\" data-start=\"2357\" dir=\"ltr\">Header Content Entry &amp; Actions</strong></h2><p data-end=\"2471\" data-start=\"2427\">Here you fill out actual <strong data-end=\"2470\" data-start=\"2452\">header content</strong>:</p><ul data-end=\"2788\" data-start=\"2473\"><li data-end=\"2517\" data-start=\"2473\"><p data-end=\"2517\" data-start=\"2475\"><strong data-end=\"2490\" data-start=\"2475\">Upload Logo</strong>: Recommended size 80x80px.</p></li><li data-end=\"2572\" data-start=\"2518\"><p data-end=\"2572\" data-start=\"2520\"><strong data-end=\"2536\" data-start=\"2520\">Header Title</strong>: Title text shown beside your logo.</p></li><li data-end=\"2631\" data-start=\"2573\"><p data-end=\"2631\" data-start=\"2575\"><strong data-end=\"2597\" data-start=\"2575\">Header Description</strong>: Supportive line under the title.</p></li><li data-end=\"2688\" data-start=\"2632\"><p data-end=\"2688\" data-start=\"2634\"><strong data-end=\"2652\" data-start=\"2634\">Header Website</strong>: URL displayed as a clickable link.</p></li><li data-end=\"2731\" data-start=\"2689\"><p data-end=\"2731\" data-start=\"2691\"><strong data-end=\"2707\" data-start=\"2691\">Header Email</strong>: Contact email address.</p></li><li data-end=\"2788\" data-start=\"2732\"><p data-end=\"2788\" data-start=\"2734\"><strong data-end=\"2757\" data-start=\"2734\">Header Phone Number</strong>: Your business contact number.</p></li></ul><h3 data-end=\"2807\" data-start=\"2790\" dir=\"ltr\">CTA Setup:</h3><ul data-end=\"3092\" data-start=\"2808\"><li data-end=\"2872\" data-start=\"2808\"><p data-end=\"2872\" data-start=\"2810\"><strong data-end=\"2822\" data-start=\"2810\">CTA Text</strong>: What the button will say (e.g., \"Schedule Now\").</p></li><li data-end=\"3092\" data-start=\"2873\"><p data-end=\"2931\" data-start=\"2875\"><strong data-end=\"2889\" data-start=\"2875\">CTA Action</strong>: Choose what happens when someone clicks:</p><ul data-end=\"3092\" data-start=\"2934\"><li data-end=\"2983\" data-start=\"2934\"><p data-end=\"2983\" data-start=\"2936\"><strong data-end=\"2943\" data-start=\"2936\">URL</strong>: Takes them to your booking or website.</p></li><li data-end=\"3036\" data-start=\"2986\"><p data-end=\"3036\" data-start=\"2988\"><strong data-end=\"2997\" data-start=\"2988\">Email</strong>: Opens an email draft to your contact.</p></li><li data-end=\"3092\" data-start=\"3039\"><p data-end=\"3092\" data-start=\"3041\"><strong data-end=\"3049\" data-start=\"3041\">Call</strong>: Dials your phone number (mobile devices).</p></li></ul></li></ul><p data-end=\"3180\" data-start=\"3094\" dir=\"ltr\">This is great for encouraging immediate action from prospects reviewing the report.</p><hr data-start=\"3182\" data-end=\"3185\"><h2 data-end=\"3232\" data-start=\"3187\"><strong data-end=\"3230\" data-start=\"3194\" dir=\"ltr\">Header Styles &amp; CTA Presentation</strong></h2><p><strong data-end=\"3230\" data-start=\"3194\" dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155048846183/original/hkLtnCL7IgGXEKkcCe8_TtozmS-J3h9pMAa91a.jpg?1750847337\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"155048846183\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; padding: 0px 1px; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0px; width: auto;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></strong><br></p><ul data-end=\"3454\" data-start=\"3266\"><li data-end=\"3454\" data-start=\"3266\"><p data-end=\"3315\" data-start=\"3268\">Choose <strong data-end=\"3292\" data-start=\"3275\">layout styles</strong> for the report header.</p><ul data-end=\"3454\" data-start=\"3318\"><li data-end=\"3375\" data-start=\"3318\"><p data-end=\"3375\" data-start=\"3320\"><strong data-end=\"3337\" data-start=\"3320\">Left Top Wave</strong>: Simple wave background for elegance.</p></li><li data-end=\"3454\" data-start=\"3378\"><p data-end=\"3454\" data-start=\"3380\"><strong data-end=\"3399\" data-start=\"3380\">Full Background</strong> (not shown here): Ideal for attention-grabbing styles.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p data-end=\"3546\" data-start=\"3456\">This visual setting determines <strong data-end=\"3526\" data-start=\"3487\">how your CTA and info blocks appear</strong> in the header area.</p><hr data-start=\"3548\" data-end=\"3551\"><h2 data-end=\"3600\" data-start=\"3553\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong data-end=\"3598\" data-start=\"3560\">Introduction Section Customization</strong></h2><p data-end=\"3712\" data-start=\"3634\">This section helps you configure the <strong data-end=\"3688\" data-start=\"3671\">intro content</strong> shown below the header.</p><p data-end=\"3712\" data-start=\"3634\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155048846156/original/pSky1l4Txykkl--6GZky4T2WGzMMtVJ-YAcf3a.jpg?1750847321\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"155048846156\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; padding: 0px 1px; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0px; width: auto;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></p><ul data-end=\"4078\" data-start=\"3714\"><li data-end=\"3770\" data-start=\"3714\"><p data-end=\"3770\" data-start=\"3716\"><strong data-end=\"3739\" data-start=\"3716\">Toggle to show/hide</strong> the entire introduction block.</p></li><li data-end=\"3863\" data-start=\"3771\"><p data-end=\"3863\" data-start=\"3773\"><strong data-end=\"3820\" data-start=\"3773\">Introduction Font Family, Weight, and Style</strong>: Customize how your intro paragraph looks.</p></li><li data-end=\"3945\" data-start=\"3864\"><p data-end=\"3945\" data-start=\"3866\"><strong data-end=\"3888\" data-start=\"3866\">Introduction Title</strong>: A short headline explaining what this section is about.</p></li><li data-end=\"4078\" data-start=\"3946\"><p data-end=\"4078\" data-start=\"3948\"><strong data-end=\"3976\" data-start=\"3948\">Introduction Description</strong>: Text giving context \u2014 great for educating the prospect on what the report covers and why it matters.</p></li></ul><p data-end=\"4172\" data-start=\"4080\">\u2705 Use this space to explain the value of the audit and how you can help fix identified gaps.</p><hr data-start=\"4174\" data-end=\"4177\"><h2 data-end=\"4220\" data-start=\"4179\"><strong data-end=\"4218\" data-start=\"4186\">Footer Section Customization</strong></h2><p data-end=\"4313\" data-start=\"4254\">Like the header, the footer section is highly customizable:</p><p data-end=\"4313\" data-start=\"4254\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155048846282/original/encSERqjwxG100X1nWxYEVAQLgtR3p03UA96c3.jpg?1750847397\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; padding: 0px 1px; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0px; width: auto;\" data-id=\"155048846282\"></p><h3 data-end=\"4345\" data-start=\"4315\" dir=\"ltr\">Footer Display Options:</h3><ul data-end=\"4410\" data-start=\"4346\"><li data-end=\"4410\" data-start=\"4346\"><p data-end=\"4410\" data-start=\"4348\">Toggle to <strong data-end=\"4371\" data-start=\"4358\">show/hide</strong> the footer description and CTA button.</p></li></ul><h3 data-end=\"4443\" data-start=\"4412\" dir=\"ltr\">Footer Content Settings:</h3><ul data-end=\"4692\" data-start=\"4444\"><li data-end=\"4529\" data-start=\"4444\"><p data-end=\"4529\" data-start=\"4446\"><strong data-end=\"4462\" data-start=\"4446\">Footer Title</strong>: A compelling CTA headline (e.g., \u201cReady to Fix Your Marketing?\u201d).</p></li><li data-end=\"4608\" data-start=\"4530\"><p data-end=\"4608\" data-start=\"4532\"><strong data-end=\"4554\" data-start=\"4532\">Footer Description</strong>: Supportive explanation of the benefits or next step.</p></li><li data-end=\"4692\" data-start=\"4609\"><p data-end=\"4692\" data-start=\"4611\"><strong data-end=\"4635\" data-start=\"4611\">Footer Font Settings</strong>: Font family, weight, and style for consistent branding.</p></li></ul><h3 data-end=\"4719\" data-start=\"4694\" dir=\"ltr\">Footer CTA Action:</h3><ul data-end=\"4844\" data-start=\"4720\"><li data-end=\"4844\" data-start=\"4720\"><p data-end=\"4778\" data-start=\"4722\">Just like in the header, you can define a button action:</p><ul data-end=\"4844\" data-start=\"4781\"><li data-end=\"4797\" data-start=\"4781\"><p data-end=\"4797\" data-start=\"4783\">Open a <strong data-end=\"4797\" data-start=\"4790\">URL</strong></p></li><li data-end=\"4820\" data-start=\"4800\"><p data-end=\"4820\" data-start=\"4802\">Trigger a <strong data-end=\"4820\" data-start=\"4812\">Call</strong></p></li><li data-end=\"4844\" data-start=\"4823\"><p data-end=\"4844\" data-start=\"4825\">Launch an <strong data-end=\"4844\" data-start=\"4835\">Email</strong></p></li></ul></li></ul><p data-end=\"4953\" data-start=\"4846\" dir=\"ltr\">? Footer CTAs are especially powerful because they capture action after the full report has been reviewed.</p><h2 data-end=\"2893\" data-start=\"2866\"><br></h2><hr data-start=\"4002\" data-end=\"4005\"><h2 data-end=\"4029\" data-start=\"4007\" dir=\"ltr\">Why This Matters</h2><p data-end=\"4094\" data-start=\"4031\">With the new <strong data-end=\"4061\" data-start=\"4044\">Web Report UI</strong> and <strong data-end=\"4084\" data-start=\"4066\">Report Builder</strong>, you can:</p><ul data-end=\"4328\" data-start=\"4095\"><li data-end=\"4155\" data-start=\"4095\"><p data-end=\"4155\" data-start=\"4097\">Deliver on-brand reports that reflect your professionalism</p></li><li data-end=\"4213\" data-start=\"4156\"><p data-end=\"4213\" data-start=\"4158\">Build trust with prospects through personalized details</p></li><li data-end=\"4268\" data-start=\"4214\"><p data-end=\"4268\" data-start=\"4216\">Boost engagement and conversions with strategic CTAs</p></li><li data-end=\"4328\" data-start=\"4269\"><p data-end=\"4328\" data-start=\"4271\">Save time by applying changes globally across all reports</p></li></ul><h2 data-end=\"4358\" data-start=\"4335\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></h2><p data-end=\"4897\" data-start=\"4720\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000002036-how-to-dispute-a-google-review-and-check-on-the-dispute-status", "title": "How to Dispute a Google Review and Check on the Dispute Status", "folder": "Review Management", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155021269534/original/mWMN-quzzkTGbHaMmxrvP4PPh6-DNMxSggc190.png?1708606694", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155021269535/original/pm_C762PQDPmU_-qp5rcEobswrnJiW-ONgc190.png?1708606694", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155021269529/original/8pMMt_-1a2jZhjX79xDCrS0FnCBX2ZnTeQ89ef.png?1708606693", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155021269531/original/aG1nnxAyIXx0SsCR6EkO4MEAuQJ3NdRy4Qc190.png?1708606694", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155021269532/original/_7szdJv88YhntUutCr8ExkC8ohEXUkPLpAc190.png?1708606694", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155021269530/original/9UvuSXRIqwGcM0iuNdvFTAze01aHr6SwUQ89ef.png?1708606693"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p data-identifyelement=\"564\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding-top: 4px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71);\">When you flag a review as inappropriate, Google may take action against the reviewer, such as removing the review or banning the reviewer from leaving future reviews. This is usually only done if the review violates Google\u2019s guidelines, such as posting spam or containing offensive language. If you believe a review is fake or biased, you can report it to Google for further investigation.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"554\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding-top: 4px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71);\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">Please Note:</strong>&nbsp;</p><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--note\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;  margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; padding: 12px 16px; border-width: 1px 1px 1px 6px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(235, 237, 240) rgb(235, 237, 240) rgb(235, 237, 240) rgb(232, 111, 37); border-image: initial; border-radius: 8px 4px 4px 8px;\">You can only dispute a review <u style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">from within the conversations tab</u> if it was generated by the system. If the review <u style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">was <strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline;\">not</strong> generated</u> from the system please <a href=\"https://support.google.com/business/workflow/9945796\" rel=\"noreferrer\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(51, 102, 187) !important; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px !important; line-height: 20px !important;\" target=\"_blank\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">start the process by clicking here </strong></a>\n<div class=\"image-container \" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><a class=\"image-enlarge-link\" href=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48254226266/original/V6iZPyYh8-AxOnz6UeavOsa9C_2qyqNPuwfbc6.gif?1664569520\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(51, 102, 187) !important; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px !important; line-height: 20px !important;\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155021269534/original/mWMN-quzzkTGbHaMmxrvP4PPh6-DNMxSggc190.png?1708606694\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib lightbox-image\" data-id=\"155021269534\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 98%; vertical-align: top; border: 0px !important; margin: 5px auto 5px 0px; display: block; float: none; width: 587px; height: 294.836px;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></a></div></pre><p data-identifyelement=\"564\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding-top: 4px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71);\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p class=\"fd-toc\"><strong>TABLE OF CONTENTS</strong></p><ul><li><a href=\"#Reporting-a-Google-Review-from-within-the-Conversation-tab\">Reporting a Google Review from within the Conversation tab</a></li><li><a href=\"#Checking-the-status-of-existing-Reviews-you-have-Reported\">Checking the status of existing Reviews you have Reported</a></li></ul><hr data-identifyelement=\"578\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 16.8269px 0px; border-width: 1px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(220, 220, 220); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><p data-identifyelement=\"579\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding-top: 4px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71);\"><br data-identifyelement=\"580\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h2 data-identifyelement=\"581\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Reporting-a-Google-Review-from-within-the-Conversation-tab\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; font-size: 1.5em; line-height: 35px !important; font-weight: 400;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"582\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">Reporting a Google Review from within the Conversation tab</strong></h2><p data-identifyelement=\"585\" dir=\"ltr\"><br>To report a Google review from within the CRM you would need to go to the Conversations tab and search for the contact you want to report the review for and click on Dispute this review:</p><p data-identifyelement=\"585\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding-top: 4px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71);\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"591\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"You-will-be-prompted-to-confirm-your-Google-email-and-business-account-associated-with-the-GMB-review-in-question.\">You will be prompted to confirm your Google email and business account associated with the GMB review in question.<br data-identifyelement=\"592\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"593\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><div class=\"image-container \" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><a class=\"image-enlarge-link\" href=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48253494223/original/fU3-oTDFmGwtrG884xKaY-c7Y9uadG2omA2d10.gif?1664305457\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(51, 102, 187) !important; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px !important; line-height: 20px !important;\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155021269535/original/pm_C762PQDPmU_-qp5rcEobswrnJiW-ONgc190.png?1708606694\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib lightbox-image\" data-id=\"155021269535\" data-index=\"1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 98%; vertical-align: top; border: 0px !important; margin: 5px auto 5px 0px; display: block; float: none; width: 534px; height: 254.735px;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></a></div><p data-identifyelement=\"594\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Next,-you'll-choose-whether-you'd-like-to-report-a-review-or-check-the-status-of-a-review-you've-already-reported:\"><br>Next, you'll choose whether you'd like to report a review or check the status of a review you've already reported:</p><p data-identifyelement=\"597\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding-top: 4px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71);\"><br></p><div class=\"image-container \" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><a class=\"image-enlarge-link\" href=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48098341984/original/l6Sg0IGlM3RP_Yb9hubRkFeT-9LgK8-LNg4a2d.png?1618435743\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(51, 102, 187) !important; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px !important; line-height: 20px !important;\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155021269529/original/8pMMt_-1a2jZhjX79xDCrS0FnCBX2ZnTeQ89ef.png?1708606693\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib fr-shadow lightbox-image\" data-id=\"155021269529\" data-index=\"2\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 98%; vertical-align: top; border: 0px !important; margin: 5px auto 5px 0px; display: block; float: none; box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12) 0px 1px 3px, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.16) 0px 1px 1px 1px; width: 525px; height: 311.062px;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></a></div><p dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">If you choose to report a new review to be removed, Google gives you a list of your recent reviews that you can click to view on Google Maps or submit a takedown request:</p><p data-identifyelement=\"600\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding-top: 4px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71);\"><br data-identifyelement=\"601\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><div class=\"image-container \" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><a class=\"image-enlarge-link\" href=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48098342358/original/dIDfNOu3Bv4rgAPuOh-SK-l34QdrFQiCWAacc5.jpg?1618435912\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(51, 102, 187) !important; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px !important; line-height: 20px !important;\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155021269531/original/aG1nnxAyIXx0SsCR6EkO4MEAuQJ3NdRy4Qc190.png?1708606694\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib fr-shadow lightbox-image\" data-id=\"155021269531\" data-index=\"3\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 98%; vertical-align: top; border: 0px !important; margin: 5px auto 5px 0px; display: block; float: none; box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12) 0px 1px 3px, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.16) 0px 1px 1px 1px; width: 512px; height: 722.824px;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></a></div><h2 data-identifyelement=\"606\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; font-size: 1.5em; line-height: 35px !important; font-weight: 400;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"566\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></h2><hr data-identifyelement=\"567\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 16.8269px 0px; border-width: 1px 0px; border-right-style: initial; border-left-style: initial; border-right-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; border-image: initial; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(220, 220, 220); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><h2 data-identifyelement=\"606\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Checking-the-status-of-existing-Reviews-you-have-Reported\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; text-rendering: optimizelegibility; font-size: 1.5em; line-height: 35px !important; font-weight: 400;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"607\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">Checking the status of existing Reviews you have Reported</strong></h2><p><br data-identifyelement=\"609\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><ul><li>To check on the status of a review that you have already reported, click here.</li><li dir=\"ltr\">If you chose to check the status of a review you previously reported, it will show you those reviews, including their current status.</li></ul><p data-identifyelement=\"614\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding-top: 4px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71);\"><br data-identifyelement=\"615\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><div class=\"image-container \" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><a class=\"image-enlarge-link\" href=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48098342472/original/aQcP06r9IEUyhL93MSYr_lvuBTTWGx5w1A247c.png?1618435962\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(51, 102, 187) !important; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px !important; line-height: 20px !important;\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155021269532/original/_7szdJv88YhntUutCr8ExkC8ohEXUkPLpAc190.png?1708606694\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib fr-bordered fr-shadow lightbox-image\" data-id=\"155021269532\" data-index=\"4\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; max-width: 98%; vertical-align: top; border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); margin: 5px auto 5px 0px; display: block; float: none; box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12) 0px 1px 3px, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.16) 0px 1px 1px 1px; width: 625px; height: 534.95px;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></a><br><br></div><p dir=\"ltr\">You can then select that review to see more of a summary and even submit an appeal if your takedown request was not accepted.</p><p><br></p><div class=\"image-container \" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><a class=\"image-enlarge-link\" href=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48098342573/original/klzJKb29MgiKe_VpSBoM5TuR_jezRmz5LAb6d3.png?1618436001\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(51, 102, 187) !important; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px !important; line-height: 20px !important;\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155021269530/original/9UvuSXRIqwGcM0iuNdvFTAze01aHr6SwUQ89ef.png?1708606693\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib fr-bordered fr-shadow lightbox-image\" data-id=\"155021269530\" data-index=\"5\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; max-width: 98%; vertical-align: top; border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); margin: 5px auto 5px 0px; display: block; float: none; box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12) 0px 1px 3px, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.16) 0px 1px 1px 1px; width: 625px; height: 534.188px;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></a><br><strong data-identifyelement=\"571\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">Please Note:</strong><br><br></div><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--note\" data-identifyelement=\"572\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap;  margin: 0px; padding: 12px 16px; border-width: 1px 1px 1px 6px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(235, 237, 240) rgb(235, 237, 240) rgb(235, 237, 240) rgb(232, 111, 37); border-image: initial; border-radius: 8px 4px 4px 8px;\">There is a limit to the number of reviews Google will show you here.<br data-identifyelement=\"630\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><a href=\"https://localu.org/google-my-business-launches-tool-to-manage-review-removal-requests/\" data-identifyelement=\"631\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(51, 102, 187) !important; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px !important; line-height: 20px !important;\"></a><br data-identifyelement=\"632\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><a data-identifyelement=\"633\" dir=\"ltr\" href=\"https://localu.org/google-my-business-launches-tool-to-manage-review-removal-requests/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(51, 102, 187) !important; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px !important; line-height: 20px !important;\" target=\"_blank\">Joy Hawkins reported</a>,<em data-identifyelement=\"634\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-style: italic;\">&nbsp;</em><br data-identifyelement=\"635\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"636\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><em data-identifyelement=\"637\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-style: italic;\">\u201cThis feature seems to only work for Google My Business accounts that have a small number of listings in them. I tried it in an account with 33 listings, and it said, \u2018Based on the number of Business Profiles you manage, this process is not available.\u2019 Our agency account also had too many listings to qualify to use it.\u201d</em></pre><p data-identifyelement=\"638\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding-top: 4px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71);\"><br data-identifyelement=\"639\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(24, 50