 font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">This article explains how to import your existing Mailchimp email templates into Design Editor, allowing you to edit them visually without needing to work with code. You\u2019ll learn how the import process works, what file types are supported, and how it converts Mailchimp layouts into editable content blocks.</p><p class=\"fd-toc\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">TABLE OF CONTENTS</strong></p><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><a href=\"https://help.gohighlevel.com/a/solutions/articles/48001219298?portalId=48000045315#%E2%80%8B%E2%80%8BWhat-is-Importing-Mailchimp-Email-Template\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(44, 92, 197);\">What is Importing Mailchimp Email Template</a></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><a href=\"https://help.gohighlevel.com/a/solutions/articles/48001219298?portalId=48000045315#Key-Benefits-of-Importing-Mailchimp-Email-Template\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(44, 92, 197);\">