uot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057346918/original/jHXdb9qBE169zgKCFLEp4sH4VO5pdcUEcAe5fa.jpg?1761940358\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib fr-bordered inline-image\" data-id=\"155057346918\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: auto;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h4 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 21.88px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><u style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Step 6:&nbsp;</strong>Save and View Statistics</u></h4><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><ul data-pm-slice=\"3 3 []\" data-spread=\"false\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Click <strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Save Action</strong>. Publish the workflow when ready.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">After sending, reopen the Email action to view <strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Statistics</strong>. Click <strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">View Details</strong> or <strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Click Performance</strong> for deeper insights.</p></li></ul><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155057346914/original/vQdAzog0BEl5luNOzxm-qdkyEEjEh6xApw8f8b.jpg?1761940356\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib fr-bordered inline-image\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; padding: 0px 1px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0px; width: auto;\" data-id=\"155057346914\"></p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Frequently Asked Questions</strong></h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-0c15e028-73ca-41d8-9f69-c9b3ba51931a\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">Q: Does the new UI change how existing emails send?</span></strong></p><p class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-50cfdd6b-b1c0-4b5d-a851-b7ee5b992057\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">No. Emails built before the update keep their original content and statistics. Open the action to upgrade its editor.</p><p class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-50cfdd6b-b1c0-4b5d-a851-b7ee5b992057\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br></p><p class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-d788974d-405c-48cd-abe8-9234fb2a6a2f\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">Q: Can I still edit HTML directly?</span></strong></p><p class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-06c7ecd7-1643-4f5a-a2ec-ff79e26b6a12\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">Yes, choose Smart Builder \u2192 Code Editor to paste or tweak raw HTML.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">Q: Is link tracking available for workflow emails?</span></strong><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Yes. Enable Track Clicks in Advanced settings to measure clicks and see link\u2011level performance.</p>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000005339-call-dispositions", "title": "Custom Dispositions on Calls on the LC Phone System", "folder": "LeadConnector Phone", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155060329117/original/4zsfCNOf94fZHfvYlUCRKxnVU7oYugwPeQb88c.png?1765377195", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155060329143/original/KFH-vD-UwH1V6p15kHUQelx0yhQM0Z99fg31ff.png?1765377221", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155060329942/original/0Y_BD9zAzBdZJWIm8ovHEj1y9t0x6v-fSg4c63.png?1765377642", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155060330427/original/d-e3YOm8Z6RSJNiYgSxgKcVnjjL38Na9lQ9e89.png?1765377893", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155060330494/original/h7OdmKAewc0CR1L9emtJaHhT6I5lY-sa7w23f3.png?1765377919", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155060330891/original/MJSIEF7oX92OXBtQugH1M5pBDYgF6vBndA7e49.png?1765378145"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<h2 data-end=\"379\" data-start=\"365\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">Overview</span></strong></h2><p data-end=\"531\" data-start=\"381\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">The <strong data-end=\"405\" data-start=\"385\">Call Disposition</strong> feature helps you capture the business outcome at the end of each call and take the right next steps, all within your dialer.</span></p><p data-end=\"789\" data-start=\"533\" dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">After completing a call, you can now select a <strong data-end=\"594\" data-start=\"579\">disposition</strong> (the outcome of the call) such as <em data-end=\"641\" data-start=\"629\">Interested</em>, <em data-end=\"666\" data-start=\"643\">Requested appointment</em>, or <em data-end=\"687\" data-start=\"671\">Not interested</em>. These dispositions can be used to track call outcomes and save time by triggering workflows.</span></p><hr data-start=\"655\" data-end=\"658\"><p data-end=\"789\" data-start=\"533\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 24px;\">Why This Matters</span></strong></p><p data-end=\"1244\" data-start=\"1208\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">By using Call Dispositions, you can:</span></p><ul data-end=\"1447\" data-start=\"1245\"><li data-end=\"1292\" data-start=\"1245\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><p data-end=\"1292\" data-start=\"1247\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Save time on manual tracking and follow-ups</span></p></li><li data-end=\"1384\" data-start=\"1293\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><p data-end=\"1384\" data-start=\"1295\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Trigger workflows instantly (e.g., send an SMS, add to a campaign, schedule a callback)</span></p></li><li data-end=\"1447\" data-start=\"1385\"><p data-end=\"1447\" data-start=\"1387\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Analyze call outcomes more effectively in&nbsp;</span><strong data-end=\"1447\" data-start=\"1429\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Call Reporting</span></strong></p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"655\" data-end=\"658\"><h1 data-end=\"230\" data-start=\"179\"><strong data-end=\"230\" data-start=\"183\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 24px;\">How to Add Custom Dispositions in Lead Connector</span></strong></h1><h3 data-end=\"2206\" data-start=\"2182\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><em>Default Dispositions</em></span></h3><p data-end=\"2336\" data-start=\"2207\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">By default, every account starts with<strong data-end=\"2272\" data-start=\"2245\" dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;preset dispositions</strong> for visibility and ease of use. Admins can add or modify these.</span></p><h3 data-end=\"2373\" data-start=\"2338\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Creating &amp; Editing Dispositions</span></h3><p data-end=\"2499\" data-start=\"2374\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Only <strong data-end=\"2401\" data-start=\"2379\">sub-account admins</strong> can create, edit, or delete dispositions.<br data-start=\"2443\" data-end=\"2446\">You can have up to <strong data-end=\"2482\" data-start=\"2464\" dir=\"ltr\">10 dispositions</strong> per sub-account.</span></p><p data-end=\"2511\" data-start=\"2501\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">To set up:</span></p><ol data-end=\"2652\" data-start=\"2512\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><li data-end=\"2553\" data-start=\"2512\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><p data-end=\"2553\" data-start=\"2515\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Go to Sub-account <strong data-end=\"2553\" data-start=\"2521\" dir=\"ltr\">Settings \u2192 Phone System \u2192 Voice \u2192 Call Dispositions</strong></span></p></li><li data-end=\"2595\" data-start=\"2554\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><p data-end=\"2595\" data-start=\"2557\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Edit the existing ones or add new ones</span></p></li></ol><h3 data-end=\"1163\" data-start=\"1111\"><br><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155060329117/original/4zsfCNOf94fZHfvYlUCRKxnVU7oYugwPeQb88c.png?1765377195\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"155060329117\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155060329143/original/KFH-vD-UwH1V6p15kHUQelx0yhQM0Z99fg31ff.png?1765377221\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155060329143\"></span></h3><hr data-start=\"1449\" data-end=\"1452\"><h2 data-end=\"1472\" data-start=\"1454\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">How It Works</span></strong></h2><p data-end=\"1707\" data-start=\"1497\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">When a call ends in the web dialer, you\u2019ll see up to <strong>10</strong><strong data-end=\"1576\" data-start=\"1550\" dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;call dispositions</strong> to choose from, for example, <em data-end=\"1619\" data-start=\"1607\" dir=\"ltr\">Follow Up</em> or <em data-end=\"1646\" data-start=\"1623\" dir=\"ltr\">Requested Appointment</em>.<br data-start=\"1647\" data-end=\"1650\">You simply select the appropriate one to log the outcome.</span></p><p data-end=\"1707\" data-start=\"1497\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></p><p data-end=\"1707\" data-start=\"1497\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155060329942/original/0Y_BD9zAzBdZJWIm8ovHEj1y9t0x6v-fSg4c63.png?1765377642\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"155060329942\"></span></p><hr data-start=\"2158\" data-end=\"2161\"><h3 data-end=\"2784\" data-start=\"2757\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Connecting to Workflows</strong></span></h3><ul data-end=\"2945\" data-start=\"2785\"><li data-end=\"2821\" data-start=\"2785\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><p data-end=\"2821\" data-start=\"2787\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Head to <strong data-end=\"2821\" data-start=\"2795\" dir=\"ltr\">Automation</strong></span></p></li><li data-end=\"2868\" data-start=\"2822\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><p data-end=\"2868\" data-start=\"2824\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Add a trigger: <strong data-end=\"2868\" data-start=\"2839\" dir=\"ltr\">Call Details<img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155060330427/original/d-e3YOm8Z6RSJNiYgSxgKcVnjjL38Na9lQ9e89.png?1765377893\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155060330427\"></strong></span></p></li><li data-end=\"2868\" data-start=\"2822\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><p data-end=\"2868\" data-start=\"2824\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Select the filter <strong dir=\"ltr\">Custom Disposition<img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155060330494/original/h7OdmKAewc0CR1L9emtJaHhT6I5lY-sa7w23f3.png?1765377919\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155060330494\"></strong></span></p></li><li data-end=\"2945\" data-start=\"2869\"><p data-end=\"2945\" data-start=\"2871\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Choose one or more dispositions to automate your desired follow-up actions</span></p></li></ul><p><br></p><p data-end=\"1804\" data-start=\"1734\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Your chosen disposition can automatically trigger workflows such as:</span></p><ul data-end=\"1929\" data-start=\"1805\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><li data-end=\"1841\" data-start=\"1805\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><p data-end=\"1841\" data-start=\"1807\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Sending a follow-up SMS or email<img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155060330891/original/MJSIEF7oX92OXBtQugH1M5pBDYgF6vBndA7e49.png?1765378145\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155060330891\"></span></p></li><li data-end=\"1841\" data-start=\"1805\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><p data-end=\"1841\" data-start=\"1807\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Scheduling an appointment</span></p></li><li data-end=\"1929\" data-start=\"1872\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><p data-end=\"1929\" data-start=\"1874\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Adding the contact to a specific pipeline or campaign</span><br><br></p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"2947\" data-end=\"2950\"><h2 data-end=\"2989\" data-start=\"2952\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">Using Dispositions in Reporting</span></strong></h2><p><br></p><p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><em>Coming soon!</em></span></p><h3 data-end=\"1947\" data-start=\"1931\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Reporting</span></h3><p data-end=\"2006\" data-start=\"1948\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">All selected dispositions are stored and can be viewed in:</span></p><ul data-end=\"2077\" data-start=\"2007\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><li data-end=\"2077\" data-start=\"2045\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><p data-end=\"2077\" data-start=\"2047\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong data-end=\"2077\" data-start=\"2047\">Reporting \u2192 Call Reporting</strong></span></p></li></ul><p data-end=\"2156\" data-start=\"2079\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">This lets you track patterns like call outcomes per user or team performance.</span></p><p data-end=\"2156\" data-start=\"2079\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></p><p data-end=\"3201\" data-start=\"2991\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">In <strong data-end=\"3012\" data-start=\"2994\" dir=\"ltr\">Call Reporting table</strong>, you\u2019ll now see a new column for <em data-end=\"3064\" data-start=\"3046\">Call Disposition</em>.<br data-start=\"3065\" data-end=\"3068\">You can also use it as a filter to analyze performance by disposition , for example, how many calls resulted in \u201cRequested Callback\u201d.</span></p><hr data-start=\"3203\" data-end=\"3206\"><h2 data-end=\"3234\" data-start=\"3208\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">Supported Call Types</span></strong></h2><p data-end=\"3263\" data-start=\"3236\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Call Dispositions work for:</span></p><ul data-end=\"3354\" data-start=\"3264\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><li data-end=\"3314\" data-start=\"3264\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><p data-end=\"3314\" data-start=\"3266\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">All<strong data-end=\"3286\" data-start=\"3270\" dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;calls</strong> made or received via the <strong data-end=\"3314\" data-start=\"3300\" dir=\"ltr\">web or mobile app</strong></span></p></li><li data-end=\"3354\" data-start=\"3315\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><p data-end=\"3354\" data-start=\"3317\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Both LC Phone and Twilio sub-accounts</span></p></li></ul><p data-end=\"3374\" data-start=\"3356\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Not supported for:</span></p><ul data-end=\"3505\" data-start=\"3375\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><li data-end=\"3505\" data-start=\"3455\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><p data-end=\"3505\" data-start=\"3457\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Calls answered via personal number or desk phone</span></p></li></ul><p data-end=\"3539\" data-start=\"3507\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mobile app support is coming soon.</span></p><hr data-start=\"3541\" data-end=\"3544\"><h2 data-end=\"3563\" data-start=\"3546\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><strong>Limitations</strong></span></h2><ul data-end=\"3767\" data-start=\"3565\"><li data-end=\"3602\" data-start=\"3565\"><p data-end=\"3602\" data-start=\"3567\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Only <strong data-end=\"3591\" data-start=\"3572\">one disposition</strong> per call</span></p></li><li data-end=\"3656\" data-start=\"3603\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><p data-end=\"3656\" data-start=\"3605\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Maximum <strong data-end=\"3632\" data-start=\"3613\">10 dispositions</strong> per account</span></p></li><li data-end=\"3721\" data-start=\"3657\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><p data-end=\"3721\" data-start=\"3659\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong data-end=\"3679\" data-start=\"3659\">Sub-dispositions</strong> (nested outcomes) are not available</span></p></li><li data-end=\"3767\" data-start=\"3722\"><p data-end=\"3767\" data-start=\"3724\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong data-end=\"3747\" data-start=\"3724\">Multiple selections</strong> are not supported</span></p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"3769\" data-end=\"3772\"><h2 data-end=\"3826\" data-start=\"3774\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><strong>Migration Note: Call Status \u2192 Call Disposition</strong></span></h2><p data-end=\"3893\" data-start=\"3828\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">If you were previously using <strong data-end=\"3872\" data-start=\"3857\">Call Status</strong> in the Power Dialer (Manual Actions):</span></p><ul data-end=\"4171\" data-start=\"3895\"><li data-end=\"3982\" data-start=\"3895\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><p data-end=\"3982\" data-start=\"3897\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">The <strong data-end=\"3933\" data-start=\"3901\">manual call status selection</strong> option has been replaced by <strong data-end=\"3982\" data-start=\"3962\">Call Disposition</strong></span></p></li><li data-end=\"4086\" data-start=\"3983\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><p data-end=\"4086\" data-start=\"3985\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Existing workflows using \u201cCall Status\u201d triggers should be updated to use the <strong data-end=\"4078\" data-start=\"4058\" dir=\"ltr\">Custom Disposition filter&nbsp;</strong>in<strong data-end=\"4078\" data-start=\"4058\" dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;Call Details Trigger</strong> instead</span></p></li><li data-end=\"4171\" data-start=\"4087\"><p data-end=\"4171\" data-start=\"4089\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Your older data will remain visible, but new automations should use the new system</span></p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"4173\" data-end=\"4176\"><h2 data-end=\"4195\" data-start=\"4178\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">Permissions</span></strong></h2><div class=\"_tableContainer_1rjym_1\"><div class=\"group _tableWrapper_1rjym_13 flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\"><table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-end=\"4360\" data-start=\"4197\"><thead data-end=\"4214\" data-start=\"4197\"><tr data-end=\"4214\" data-start=\"4197\"><th data-col-size=\"sm\" data-end=\"4204\" data-start=\"4197\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Role</span></th><th data-col-size=\"sm\" data-end=\"4214\" data-start=\"4204\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Action</span></th></tr></thead><tbody data-end=\"4360\" data-start=\"4233\"><tr data-end=\"4278\" data-start=\"4233\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-end=\"4241\" data-start=\"4233\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Admin</span></td><td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-end=\"4278\" data-start=\"4241\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Create, Edit, Delete dispositions</span></td></tr><tr data-end=\"4319\" data-start=\"4279\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-end=\"4286\" data-start=\"4279\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">User</span></td><td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-end=\"4319\" data-start=\"4286\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Select disposition after call</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><h2 data-end=\"4389\" data-start=\"4367\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></h2><hr data-start=\"4540\" data-end=\"4543\"><h2 data-end=\"4562\" data-start=\"4545\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">FAQs</span></strong></h2><p data-end=\"4777\" data-start=\"4564\"><strong data-end=\"4570\" data-start=\"4564\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(44, 130, 201); font-size: 14px;\">Q:</span></strong><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(44, 130, 201);\">&nbsp;What if I don\u2019t select a disposition after a call?</span><br data-start=\"4621\" data-end=\"4624\"><strong data-end=\"4630\" data-start=\"4624\">A:</strong> Dispositions are optional and you can choose not to select any disposition at all.</span></p><p data-end=\"4890\" data-start=\"4779\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></p><p data-end=\"5017\" data-start=\"4892\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong data-end=\"4898\" data-start=\"4892\"><span style=\"color: rgb(44, 130, 201);\">Q:</span></strong><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 130, 201);\">&nbsp;How many dispositions can I have?</span><br data-start=\"4935\" data-end=\"4938\"><strong data-end=\"4944\" data-start=\"4938\">A:</strong> Currently, up to 10 are supported.</span></p><p data-end=\"5017\" data-start=\"4892\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></p><p data-end=\"5149\" data-start=\"5019\" dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong data-end=\"5025\" data-start=\"5019\"><span style=\"color: rgb(44, 130, 201);\">Q:</span></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(44, 130, 201);\">&nbsp;Can I trigger a workflow from a deleted disposition?</span><br data-start=\"5078\" data-end=\"5081\"><strong data-end=\"5087\" data-start=\"5081\">A:</strong> No. Once deleted, associated workflows will stop triggering.</span></p><p data-end=\"5149\" data-start=\"5019\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p data-end=\"5149\" data-start=\"5019\" dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong data-end=\"6111\" data-start=\"6068\"><span style=\"color: rgb(44, 130, 201);\">Q: Do Call Dispositions work on mobile?</span></strong><br data-start=\"6111\" data-end=\"6114\">&nbsp;A: Mobile app support is coming soon.</span></p><p data-end=\"5149\" data-start=\"5019\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p data-end=\"5149\" data-start=\"5019\" dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong data-end=\"6224\" data-start=\"6156\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(44, 130, 201);\">Q: What about calls I answer on my personal phone or desk phone?</span></strong><br data-start=\"6224\" data-end=\"6227\">&nbsp;A: Those calls cannot use dispositions. The web or mobile app is required for now.</span></p><p data-end=\"5149\" data-start=\"5019\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p data-end=\"5149\" data-start=\"5019\" dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong data-end=\"6224\" data-start=\"6156\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(44, 130, 201);\">Q: What happened to the Call Status Trigger?</span></strong><br data-start=\"6224\" data-end=\"6227\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">A: It has been renamed to <strong dir=\"ltr\">Call Details</strong> and now supports the new filter of <strong dir=\"ltr\">Custom Disposition. Call Status</strong> is still a filter on the Call Details trigger but different from Disposition.</span></span></p>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000006555-magic-links-in-memberships-courses-", "title": "Magic Links In Memberships (Courses)", "folder": "Memberships", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155055395802/original/vD9DCgTZaQDZNpa_iFvMFcikxVMzHC2DVwa462.png?1759830358", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155055395785/original/HbutawjgLU0inQavztzee8ZyYxQdK94v3Aa462.png?1759830358", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155055395788/original/J_uZsz-3QTsBZCBkExK7vnFnTc_gpzy5OAaf1c.jpg?1759830357", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155055395779/original/DJq6NoDdZOnBPuEp7IRNGyOWYydoGs1lCgaf1c.png?1759830357", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155055395803/original/cMZTh7Ax6TXbuGTWpoxvWF2ESl3nImmvnQa462.jpg?1759830358", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155055395806/original/oZ8MWQ5N42yi3ChSuLY9NCS_vl4zOGB3cQ04cf.jpg?1759830360", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155055395805/original/8fjLnmE2Sv44S_Y_dOOU0bNlEWpPFQLopAcd45.jpg?1759830359", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155055395804/original/D090ZohwVmuw5HDxXEJkjBIKWsSt5WyyYw04cf.png?1759830360", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155055395801/original/yGxs5fkX0iJpMnsTDbGmEWzODFZGmllXwQa462.png?1759830358", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155055395781/original/9GxS0bZhxaovW-MRAE_krsTVGvH-fxKhhwa462.png?1759830358"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p class=\"tdfocus-1678459994305\" data-identifyelement=\"1003\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">Have you ever been in a situation where you're trying to get somebody in membership, or you want to get them in quickly, and they've lost their password, or they can't figure out how to log in? A Memberships magic link is the one-click solution for that. The fastest way to get your customers and users into your membership courses is if they forget their username or password.</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1678459994305\" data-identifyelement=\"1003\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Please note:</strong></p><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--note\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow: visible; font-family: monospace, monospace; font-size: 13px; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-break: normal; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 12px 16px; border-width: 1px 1px 1px 6px; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(235, 237, 240) rgb(235, 237, 240) rgb(235, 237, 240) rgb(232, 111, 37); border-image: initial; border-radius: 8px 4px 4px 8px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><u dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Newly created locations&nbsp;must use client portal magic links</u></strong>. You can create magic links in the Client Portal. Go to \"Sites\" &gt; \"Client Portal\" &gt; \"Dashboard\" to generate magic links for your clients.</span></pre><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><br></p><h2 class=\"tdfocus-1679921503227\" data-identifyelement=\"1005\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1679921525998\" data-identifyelement=\"1006\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">What is a Magic link in Memberships?</strong></h2><p class=\"tdfocus-1679921503227\" data-identifyelement=\"1005\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1058\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1679921503227\" data-identifyelement=\"1005\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">The magic link is designed to side-step having to use a username and password to log in. Once logged in, clients will see whatever \"products\" you/they have been granted <span class=\"tdfocus-1679921692914\" data-identifyelement=\"1059\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">access&nbsp;</span>to. It is meant to give clients access only to the products they have been granted access to.<br><br></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1681219034282\" data-identifyelement=\"1065\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">Membership sites can be great for sharing valuable content with your customers or users. However, sometimes logging in can be a hassle, especially if someone forgets their password. That's where Membership magic links come in. These one-click links allow your clients to quickly and easily access your courses without remembering their usernames or password. Whether sending out the link via email or using it as a custom menu link, Membership magic links make it easy to grant access to your courses to those who need it. Just be sure only to share the link with those granted access to your content. So, if you're looking for a hassle-free way to get your customers into your courses, consider using Membership magic links.</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1681219034282\" data-identifyelement=\"1066\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1067\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1681219034282\" data-identifyelement=\"1068\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1069\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h3 class=\"tdfocus-1681219034282\" data-identifyelement=\"1070\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 20px; font-size: 1.17em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"1071\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">What are the benefits of Membership Magic Links?</strong></h3><p data-identifyelement=\"1072\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">The benefits of Membership Magic Links can be summarized into two main points:</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1681219167141\" data-identifyelement=\"1073\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1074\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1681219160939\" data-