681217282969\" data-identifyelement=\"1164\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span class=\"tdfocus-1681217289729\" data-identifyelement=\"1165\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit;\">Magic Link can expire If you generate a new one. Older ones will be invalid.</span></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1681217338946\" data-identifyelement=\"1166\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"1167\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h3 class=\"tdfocus-1681217338946\" data-identifyelement=\"1168\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.17em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1681217775602\" data-identifyelement=\"1169\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Does a contact need access to an offer for a magic link to work for them?</strong></h3><p class=\"tdfocus-1681217338946\" data-identifyelement=\"1170\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">It doesn't work for contacts who don't have a membership offer granted to them.</p><p class=\"tdfocus-1681217338946\" data-identifyelement=\"1171\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155055395781/original/9GxS0bZhxaovW-MRAE_krsTVGvH-fxKhhwa462.png?1759830358\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib inline-image\" data-id=\"155055395781\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border: 0px; max-width: 100%; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 5px; margin-left: 0px; display: block; text-align: left; width: auto;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></p><h3 class=\"tdfocus-1681217338946\" data-identifyelement=\"1175\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.17em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1681217759345\" data-identifyelement=\"1176\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">When testing, when I click on a magic link, it shows all the courses the contact should not have access to.</strong></h3><p class=\"tdfocus-1681217686106\" data-identifyelement=\"1177\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">This is an Agency Admin privilege; when you click on a Magic Link being an Agency admin, it auto logs you in as someone with access to all courses. If you want to do some testing, try opening a magic link in incognito.</p>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000002483-understanding-pixel-id-for-your-funnel-website-event-tracking", "title": "Creating a New Facebook Pixel", "folder": "Events", "images": [], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\">To effectively manage event tracking on your website, follow these steps to locate and create your Pixel ID:</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><h2>Creating a New Facebook Pixel</h2><p><br></p><ol><li dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Access Facebook Ads Manager:</strong><ul><li dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">Open your Facebook Ads Manager.</span></strong></li><li dir=\"ltr\">Click on the top menu and select the \u201cPixels\u201d link.</li></ul></li><li dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Create a Pixel:</strong><ul><li dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">If no pixel is currently associated with your account, you will see a prompt to create one.</span></strong></li><li dir=\"ltr\"><strong dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">Click the green \u201cCreate a Pixel\u201d button.</span></span></strong></li></ul></li><li dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Name Your Pixel:</strong></span><ul><li dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">Enter a name for your new pixel.</span></strong></span></li><li dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">Click \u201cCreate\u201d to finalize the process.</span></span></strong></span><br><br></li></ul></li></ol><p dir=\"ltr\">Your new pixel is now ready and can be installed in your sales funnels and websites.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000003063-associations-amongst-objects", "title": "Creating Associations", "folder": "Associations", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155030887096/original/psdMFSbIyXp9g7J6t5WQ2MapKw8Yq5prDw0899.png?1723474138", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155030884994/original/L34G3P0_Yc7mGb6ICOSvja-Zsy4OZnIEjgfbac.png?1723473005", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155030887082/original/MB7eOg4xl_JZhxZRzMCggR_Zus95zhjRXw01c8.jpg?1723474122", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155030887151/original/5mAnqtCOXtbeIRK3K-QXF38I8BuiHeGp0w4ee9.png?1723474160", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155030887208/original/c4koMP5LeC548R6-dUN47agKEc61E_6I3w3b33.png?1723474187", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155030887666/original/TpraYd5gJyeK18OwvDFC-mzTFXxcFUuyFw1c95.png?1723474533", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155030887842/original/KYwlSCOj-NSSb0JDsgwuF1NFrVgC-FUxfAc21b.png?1723474669"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-7c40331e-d282-4089-8558-cda139a6f553\" dir=\"ltr\">This document provides a comprehensive overview of the \"Association for Custom Objects\" feature, detailing how users can establish associations between custom objects and contacts or between custom objects themselves. &nbsp;</div><p><br></p><p class=\"fd-toc\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">In This Article</strong></p><p class=\"fd-toc\"><br></p><ul><ul><li><a href=\"#Creating-Associations\">Creating Associations</a></li><li><a href=\"#Managing-Associations\">Managing Associations</a></li><li><a href=\"#Associating-Two-Records-Using-One-or-Multiple-Labels\">Associating Two Records Using One or Multiple Labels</a></li></ul></ul><p><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Feature/action-1---Filtering\"></a></p><hr><h2 class=\"ql-heading\" data-block-id=\"block-0cb409f4-122b-4fe0-b644-425440b455bd\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--note\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><pre class=\"fd-callout fd-callout--note\" dir=\"ltr\">Currently we support association of contacts to other contacts or custom objects. Also - we support association of custom objects with any other custom objects.</pre><br></h2><h2 class=\"ql-heading\" data-block-id=\"block-0cb409f4-122b-4fe0-b644-425440b455bd\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Creating-Associations\">Creating Associations</h2><h4 id=\"Steps-to-Create-Associations:\">Steps to Create Associations:</h4><ol><li><p><strong>Access the Custom Objects Section:</strong></p><ul><li>Navigate to <strong dir=\"ltr\">Subaccounts &gt; Settings &gt; &nbsp;Objects</strong>.</li><li dir=\"ltr\">Select the object you wish to create an association for.</li><li dir=\"ltr\">Click on the <strong>Associations</strong> tab.<img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155030887096/original/psdMFSbIyXp9g7J6t5WQ2MapKw8Yq5prDw0899.png?1723474138\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155030887096\"><strong dir=\"